boundary, eight integration controls/generated outputs, three architecture checks, Lending subpath suite loading and Counter bundler loading. They are not unioned into the green gate. Scripted reset/SQLite faults, RefcountedCanceler abort/timeout stack and four content-type warnings remain in the final raw log. Stability request 1d3a13e3 is not cured by this pass.\n\nMy scratch regeneration used the qualified shared third-party view with exact candidate workspace links, tsx4.21.0 and esbuild0.28.1; the 349-input compile-only graph excludes the two recorded root mismatches (Wrangler/unenv-preset). This is not a fully locked root or a separate Cloudflare gate. No whole suite/gate was repeated by checker.\n\n3. Preservation and remaining obligations\n\nMy independent catalog comparison confirms all 36 historical canonical native definition bodies are unchanged against the approved baseline; all 41 current entries validate and are runnable, with exactly five added pins. This data comparison alone is not proof of all historical behavior; the preserved branches and gate supply the corresponding behavioral evidence. The default cohort is unchanged. Retiring the Counter-specific new-room selection, host dispatch, generated browser modules/builds and their old static-route tests is deliberate; generic native-route/retirement/cache/browser witnesses replace that active serving boundary. Historical definitions, native judging/replay and dated acceptance records remain.\n\nNo blocking finding. Nonblocking N1: docs/self-host.md:183 links to deploy.md#trusted-application-packages, while the target heading is “Trusted application screens” (#trusted-application-screens). Correct that anchor in the next documentation change; it does not block this runtime delivery.\n\nLocal landing, sealed receipt, Main audit and parent reconciliation remain owed. The M1 parent stays open until all children are landed/audited. No publication, Cloudflare provisioning/deployment, hostile-package containment, authenticated Git transport, upgrades or live provider acceptance is granted by this approval.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:b02ae22d7bf0f9627c40700a8774220eb3919fa9","binding":"assigned","head":"432dab40a60a90bd0570e17ae7d73c17febb2986","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:b4af9b04cd09eb1da2a500b30a3820ce96eba1f4\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:d299657b6432ac7182563dedf27166c9c241e128\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:63dc4e4edff6939598094b5b4e9e08480ee51ec1","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"approved"}}